(29, 15, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 48690.00000, 4.00, NULL, NULL, 23, 'Desktop Computer Set:                                                                                                                                                                    Specifications:\r\n\'Component: Desktop Set\r\nCore i5 13500 or Higher (LGA 1700) with integrated graphics\r\nmotherboard B660 or H610 higher (Socket LGA 1700) (MATX, LAN, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, HDMI x2, Display Port 2, USB 3.2 Gen 1 Type C, USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type A, USB 2.0 x6, OS Windows 11 pro, DDR5 5600 MHZ 16GB (2x8GB) Dual Channel, 1 TB M.2 2280 (PCle Gen 3.0 x 4, NVME 1.4, Read/ Write up to 7,450/ 6,900 BM/s or Higher, 80 Plus Bronze PSU (750watts), Keyboard (Full keys, adjustable keyboard height, 10-key number pad and up to 10 million keystrokes) and mouse (Optical tracking, 3 buttons: left, right, middle or scroll), 27\" monitor IPS panel atleast 75 hz or higher, 1ms. Desktop Set w/ 1 year warranty\r\nOFFER: DESKTOP SET (CUSTOMIZED)\r\n1 Intel Core i5-13400 ( 1.8GHz up to 4.6GHz) Raptorlake/13th Gen/20MB/10 Cores/16 Threads/LGA 1700 Processor\r\n2 Kingston 8GB DDR4 3200Hz Fury Beast Black (KF432C16BB/8) Memory\r\n1 Kingston 1TB NV2 PCIE 4.0 NVME M.2 2280 (SNV2S/1000G) R/W 3500/2100 MB/S Solid State Drive\r\n1 Vikings Mace VKM-33  Black (120mm Fans x3) RGB Tempered Glass M-ATX Mid-Tower Gaming Chassis\r\n1 Windows 11 Professional 64 Bit Eng International BLK/BNC (FQC-10528/29//21 H2/BTC-03301/20H2/22H2/23H2)\r\n1 Logitech K120+B100 Keyboard and Mouse Combo\r\n1 Dell 27\" SE 2722H 1920x1080/75Hz/VA/16:9/HDMI.VGA/Freesync\r\n1 Silverstone Attis 750W 80+ Bronze (SST-AT750R-BF) PCIE 5.0 Non-Modular True-Rated Power Supply\r\n1 MSI Pro H610M-E DDR4 S1700 (12th Gen)/2DDR4/XPCIE4.0/3.0/M.2/HDMI/VGA/S/USB3.2/2.0/GLAN MATX Motherboard\r\n1 ASUS PCE-AX3000/Dual Band/IEEE 802.11 AX/Bluetooth 5.0/PCIE Wireless Adapter\r\nSF-A-A'),
(30, 16, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6800.00000, 4.00, NULL, NULL, 17, 'ICT Equipment:\r\nDesktop Monitor:                                                                                                                                                                    Specifications:\r\n\'IPS  Panel\r\n Size: Atleast 27 inches or higher\r\nREFRESH Rate: Atleast 140 hz or higher                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        1ms response time                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            HDMI x Display Port                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Resolution: 1920 x1080 up to 2560 x 1440                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 VESA Mount\r\nOFFER:\r\nIPS FHD Resolution\r\nAdaptive Sync, Compatible with Nvidia G-SYNC Compatible and AMD FreeSync\r\n120Hz refresh rate, less strain for eyes\r\n1ms Visual Response Boost (VRB)\r\n178° wide view angle\r\n6 axis color adjustment\r\nZeroFrame\r\nAcer Display Widget-simplifies monitor tweaking\r\nAcer VisionCare for comfy viewing\r\nENERGY STAR® Certified'),
