(32, 18, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 21149.00000, 3.00, NULL, NULL, 17, 'ICE 3 Remote Temperature \r\nMonitoring Device\r\nWorld Health Organization'),
(33, 19, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 100000.00000, 3.00, NULL, NULL, 23, 'Package A for RHU\r\n\"The package is Inclusive of the following:\r\nA. Automatic BP Apparatus, non-mercurial, with adult and pedia cuffs- 2 Units\r\n~ Automatic inflation/ built~in inflation system\r\n~ Separate cuff size for pedia and adult sizes\r\n~ Digital LCD display. Displays systolic/diastolic, pulse rate, low battery, time/date\r\n~ Automatic power off when not in operation for 1~2 minutes\r\n~ with memory function \r\n~ With an of accuracy reading of not more than +/~ 3mmHg Safety feature:automatic deflation with pressure above 250mmHg\r\n~ with dual power source: AC 220V and Rechargeable batteries and charger\r\n\r\nB. Stethoscope- 2 units\r\n- Acoustic performance-7\"\r\n- Tunable diagphragm for adult, non-tunable for pedia\r\n- Dual-lumen tubing\r\n- With two-sided chestpiece\r\n- Adjustable headset. Angled ear tubes align with ear canals\r\n- Latex-free or phthalate plasticiser-free\r\nC. Delivery Set, complete- 1 unit\r\nMade of medical grade stainless steel \r\n2 pcs Hemostatic/Kelly Forceps, curve or straight 1 pc Kidney Basin Large, 10in \r\n1 pc Surgical Scissors (Straight Mayo) \r\n1 pc Needle Holder, 8in 1 pc Thumb \r\nForceps, 6 in 1 pc Rankin Forceps, 6in \r\n1 pc Bandage Scissor, 7.5in \r\n1 pc Tissues Forceps (with teeth) \r\n1 pc sterile plastic umbilical cord clamp(s) or ties \r\n1 pc Umbilical Cord Scissors \r\n*Contents should be placed in an autoclavable stainless steel instrument cassette with locking clips\r\nAll instruments should be laser printed with \"DOH-CHD-CAR\"\r\nD. Dental Instruments Set, complete-1 Set\r\n1. Extraction Forcep # 16, 17, 18R, 18L, 44, 69, 150, 151 - With cross seration for better grip; American pattern; Ergonomic for better comfort; Roba-designed instrument\r\n2. Aspirating Syringe - 1.8-2.2ml \r\n3. Minnesota Retractor - Stainless Steel\r\n4. Bone File - Stainless Steel\r\n5. Bone Currette - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n6. Gum Separator - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n7. Seldin - Stainless Steel\r\n8. Root Tip Pick STR, LEFT and RIGHT - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n9. Blade Handle #3 - Stainless Steel\r\n10. Elevator #301, 304 - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n11. Surgical Mallet - Stainless Steel\r\n12. Iris Straight and Curved - Stainless Steel\r\n13. Adson tissue Forcep - Stainless Steel\r\n14. Molt #9 - Stainless Steel\r\n15. Hemostat Mosquito Forcep - Stainless Steel\r\n16. Periosteal elevator - Stainless Steel\r\n17. Bone Rongeur - Stainless Steel\r\n18. Allis Tissue - Stainless Steel\r\n19. Needle Holder - Stainless Steel\r\n20. Apical Elevator Right and Left - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n21. Cryer East and West - Non magnetic hallow handle\r\n22. Pedo Forcep 150SK, 151SK, 17SK, 16SK, 18RSK, 18LSK - Stainless Steel American Pattern Standard\r\n23. Universal Scaler - Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n24. Perio Currette- Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n25. Gracey Currette Set of 6 Different Tips - Non Magnetic Hallow Handle\r\n26. Periodontal Probe- Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n27. Woodson- Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n28. Ash Instrument - Stainless Steel\r\n29. Cement Spatula - Stainless Steel\r\n30. Articulating Paper Forceps (Miller) Straight - Stainless Steel\r\n31. Explorer- Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n32. Mouth Mirror with Handle (No.4)- Non-magnetic hallow handle\r\n33. Cotton Plier with Lock - Stainless Steel\r\n34. Ball Burnisher - Stainless Steel\r\n35. Plastic Filling Instrument - Stainless Steel\r\n36. Anatomic Burnisher - Stainless Steel\r\n37. Composite Instrument - Stainless Steel\r\n38. Matrix band Holder (Tofflemire) - Stainless Steel\r\n39. Spoon Excavator - Stainless Steel\r\n40. Plugger - Stainless Steel\r\n41. Instrument Cassette for Sterilization - Large with locking mechanism\r\n*Preferably, contents are placed in an instrument kit; or contents placed in individual plastic bags\r\nAll instruments should be laser printed with \"DOH-CHD-CAR\"\r\nE. Minor Surgery Set\r\n- Surgical scissors straight\r\n- Surgical scissors curved\r\n- Bandage scissors\r\n- Pick up (Ovum) forceps\r\n- Mosquito Forceps\r\n- Tissue forceps with teeth\r\n- Tissue forceps without teeth\r\n- Suture Removal Scissors\r\n*Contents should be placed in an autoclavable stainless steel instrument cassette with locking clips\r\nAll instruments should be laser printed with \"DOH-CHD-CAR\"\r\nF. Nebulizer, Big- 1 unit\r\nCompressor-driven which is maintenance and oil-free.\r\nAtomization/nebulization rate: ≥ 0.25 ml/min \r\nFlow Rate: ≥ 7 liters per minute\r\nParticulate size/MmAD: ≤ 5um Noise generated: ≤ 55 dB 1 meter from machine \r\nWorking Temperature: 5~40°C Electrical \r\nRequirements: 220 VAC (+/~ 10%) 60 Hz Accessories. reusable mouthpiece, tubing set, adult and pediatric face mask, nebulizer tank, air filter and carry bag\r\nG. Multifunctional Percussion Diagnostic Reflex Percussion Hammer Set- 1 set\r\nMaterial: Medical grade stainless steel\r\nconsists of: \r\n1. Pinwheel / Geer Wheel Hammer\r\n2. T-shape Hammer / Triple-cornered Hammer\r\n3. Taylor Buck Hammer\r\n4. Babinski Hammer / Metal Rod Hammer\r\n5. Plastic Rod Hammer\r\nH. Non-mercurial thermometer, Digital- 2 units\r\nNon-contact type (scanner) with high precision infrared sensor\r\nFor Ear, Forehead, ambient temperature\r\nLCD digital display\r\nsurface temperature mode: normal, high, fever\r\nMeasuring distance range: 5-15cm\r\nResponse time: ≤0.4sec\r\nAccuracy: ±0.2°C\r\nWith over range indicator\r\nPower off mode: Auto/Manual\r\nMemory: ≥60recalls \r\nWater proof\r\nI. 3-in-1 Glucometer- 1 unit\r\nISO 15197 With Internal Quality Control LCD display with internal storage memory Power Supply Input:\r\nBattery Operated: \'AA\'/\'AAA\'\r\nStandard Accessories\r\n1. Box of 100 Test Strips for glucose, 100 strips for uric acid and 100 strips for cholesterol (with expiry date at least 1 yr from delivery) (strips available at local drugstores nationwide)\r\n2. 1 Lancing Device\r\n3. 150 Lancets\r\n4. 1 Carrying case\r\nJ. Salter Scale (50kg capacity)- 1 unit\r\nHeavy Duty, hanging\r\nWith 2 pcs. Hanging Hooks and baby hanging trousers\r\nLarge easy to read dial display with white background\r\nCapacity: 25 kg x 50kgs\r\nResolution: 0.1 kg\r\nAccuracy: 0.1%\r\nNet Weight: not more than 800 gms\r\nK. Bag Valve Mask (adult and pedia)- 1 set\r\n- Autoclavable\r\n- ADULT: 1.5L bag, with pressure relief valve (60cmH20), size 5 mask With 2pcs face mask, 3pcs oral airway, reservoir bag and oxygen tubing \r\n- PEDIATRIC: 550ml bag with pressure relief valve (40cmH20), size 3 mask\r\n- With 2pcs face mask, 3pcs oral airway, reservoir bag and oxygen tubing\r\nL. Handheld Pulse Oximeter- 2 units\r\nSpO2: measurement range: 35-100%\r\naccuracy: ± 2%\r\nresolution: 1%\r\nPulse Rate: Measurement range : 30-250 bpm\r\nAccuracy: ± 2bpm\r\nResolution: 1bpm\r\nAlarm Function: Audible and visual alarms for high/low SpO2 and PR\r\nWith Low Signal Quality Alarm, & Low battery indicator\r\nPower requirements: Compatible with lithium batteries and standard \"AA\" size batteries. Includes Rechargeable lithium battery and charger.\r\nBattery runtime: at least 10 hours IPX2 Dimensions: Manufacturer\'s dimensions\r\nM. Digital medical tape measure- 2 units\r\n- measures up to 9 different body parts\r\n- measurement units: inches and cm\r\n- Stores previous measurements \r\n- 80 inch / 190cm extendable tape\r\n- 2 measuring Mode: circumferences and linear mode\r\n- Bright LCD digital display\r\n- With free battery/ies and battery charger\r\nN. Pen light- 1 set\r\n- 2 pcs penlights (white & yellow light) made of alluminum alloy\r\n- With push button on/off switch\r\n- Powered by two (2) AAA batteries\r\n- with pupil gauge\r\n- Dimensions: Manufacturer\'s\r\nO. Fetal Doppler, Desk top- 1 unit\r\nFeatures and Specifications:\r\nHigh Sensitivity water proof probes: 2 Hz or  3 Hz probe\r\nColor LCD- at least 3.5 inches\r\nLarge backlit LCD display\r\nFHR detection with high fidelity sound\r\nBuilt-in audio recorder\r\nRechargeable Battery: Lithium Polymer\r\nAuto shut-off\r\nFHR Range: 30-240bpm\r\nAlarm Sound Speaker: Built-in loud speaker with volume control\r\nStandard Accessories:\r\nAC Adapter (Auto volt)\r\nWith carrying case\r\nP. ECG machine- 1 unit\r\nAutomatically interprets results / w/ ECG analysis and diagnosis program approved by AHA, CSE database\r\n12 channel\r\nAt least 10 inches color touch screen 12 leads, 3 channels\r\nBuilt in rechargeable lithium battery with at least 3 hours continuous operation\r\nPeripheral ports: USB and LAN\r\n12 lead simultaneous acquisition\r\nComplete digital filters and self-adapting filtering\r\nUp to 300seconds \r\nWith voice reminder and visual alarming for lead-off, low battery, and low on paper\r\nLocal storage capacity of up to 3000 ECG recordings\r\nIncludes: 10 pole patient cable, 4 electrodes clip-on (ends), 6 cardiac suction electrodes, AC/220V power supply, Rechargeable battery, printer paper\r\nQ. ENT Diagnostic Set ( Ophthalmoscope, Otoscope) - 1 set\r\nBayonet locking, mounts to the battery handle\r\nWith rechargeable batteries and charger\r\nStainless steel battery handle with knurled finish\r\nRheostatic on/off switch\r\n5 specula, size 2.75mm\r\n5 specula, size 4.25mm\r\nOtoscope\r\nChrome-plated otoscope head with removable 4x magnifying lens, and insufflator fitting\r\nAdapter to allow use with disposable specula\r\nNasal speculum adapter with manual screw opening for instrumentation connects to the otoscope head\r\nOphthalmoscope Head \r\nWith lens wheel featuring 25 corrective lenses from 25 to +40 diopters\r\nR. Surgical Skin Stapler\r\nreusable, autoclavable, at least 100 times usage,\r\nS. Surgical Staple remover (1 pc)\r\nstainless steel, autoclavable\r\nT. Alligator forceps (2 pcs)\r\nmedical grade stainless steel, 3.5\" and 5.5\"\r\nU. Hartmann Nasal Speculum Set (3 pcs)\r\nmedical grade stainless steel, size, small, medium and large\r\nAccessories:\r\nLuggage Bag - 1 unit\r\nWill contain the medical equipment\r\nQuality: scratch and impact resistant, light weight yet durable made of polypropylene. Water resistant, hard case trolley bag\r\nDimensions: at least 75cm x 54cm x 31cm. Capacity-at least 123 L\r\nFeatures: 4 wheel Mint Green trolley bag comes with a number lock. Adjustable handle. With 360 degrees maneuverable wheels.\r\nColor: Mint Green\r\nWith laser printed DOH logo on handle (at least 1inch), front (12x12) and top (at least 6\")\r\nBackpack- 1 unit\r\nCapacity: not less than 29L \r\nMaterials: 100% Polyester; Water resistant and lightweight\r\nDimensions: 18.5\"(H) x 13\"(W) x 7.5\"(D)\r\nColor: Mint Green\r\nWith laser printed DOH logo (front) 6 inches and DOH-CAR (HFEP) letters- 2 inches\r\n'),
