(613, 280, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34150.00000, 1.00, NULL, 0, 17, 'HEAVY DUTY AUTOMATIC PAPER SHREDDER\nSheet Capacity: 200 sheets automatic and 10 sheets manual shredding capacities\nAuto Reverse: stops and reverses paper if a jam occurs, silent shred\nSleep mode feature: shuts down after 2 minutes of inactivity\nShreds size: 4 x 38mm cross-cut\nBin capacity: 32L\n220V\n\"OFFER: \nDeli ET088\nKey Features:\n• High-Capacity Auto-Feed: Shreds up to 200 sheets (70gsm) at once, turning each A4 paper into over 2598 tiny particles (2 x 12 mm).\n• Manual Feed Mode: Handles up to 10 sheets at a time with a continuous shredding time of 30 minutes.\n• Extended Continuous Shredding Time: Auto-feed mode supports up to 60 minutes of uninterrupted shredding.\n• 32L Waste Bin: Features a pull-out design with a viewing window for easy waste level monitoring and simple disposal.\n• Overheat Protection: Prevents damage during prolonged use with automatic cooling features.\n• Auto Shut-Off: Engages when the waste bin is removed to prevent messes and ensure safety.\n\"\n\"• One-Key Reverse: Allows for quick reversal to clear paper jams and prevent shredding errors.\n• Elegant Design: Designed by our German team for a more refined and luxurious appearance compared to similar products.\nSpecifications:\n• Paper Feed Width: 220 mm, • Rated Voltage: 230V~/50Hz, • Rated Power: 300 watts, • Paper Bin Volume: 32 liters, • Shredding Type: Segmental (confetti), • Device Size: 480 x 350 x 545 mm, • Shred Size: 2 x 12 mm, • Noise Level: ≤70 dB, • Shredding Speed: 2 meters per minute, • Device Net Weight: 17 kg, • Paper Shredding Capacity (70gsm, A4): Manual - 10 sheets; Auto - 200 sheets, • Continuous Work Time: Manual - 30 minutes; Auto - 60 minutes, • Alarm for Full Paper Bin: Yes\"'),
